                                                "sense_id": "c7b64c81-8f4b-37a9-8ae4-d65ddfb0929f",
                                                "text": "Globalization has re-ordered the global economy in ways that are destructive to civic stability, as decentralized, localized producers cannot compete with globalized, commoditized crops, capital, labor and goods."
